── outcome in the wrong case
exit 2
feov-record: invalid argument "ceiling" for "--as" flag: --as must be one of VERIFIED|CEILING|HALTED|UNVERIFIED (got "ceiling") — "ceiling" differs from "CEILING" only in case, and the report's verdict stamp switches on this word — an unrecognized one falls through to a bare stamp, so a lowercase CEILING loses the "this is NOT a judged failure to verify" caveat the stamp exists to carry

    VERIFIED    red passed the board and the bench agrees the question was answered
    CEILING     the round ceiling was reached with work still open — NOT a judged failure to verify, and the stamp says so
    HALTED      the bench ended the run on a safety, ethics, consent or integrity boundary
    UNVERIFIED  the run ended without the question being answered, and no ceiling or halt explains it

